          <li><a href="#pour-points" target="_top" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">5. Low-Temperature Fluidics and Paraffinic Wax Challenges</a></li>
          <li><a href="#api-groups" target="_top" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">6. API Base Oil Groups: The Universal Sourcing Matrix</a></li>
